source: crates/instrukt-cli/tests/harness.rs
expression: help
---
The sessions facade over the configured runtime

Usage: instrukt sessions <COMMAND>

Commands:
  run           Start a session through the runtime mapping; prints its id
  send          Send text to a session; prints its id
  alive         Print a session's status: running, needs-input, ended ok, ended failed or gone
  conversation  Print a session's conversation
  link          Link two sessions of one runtime, or remove their link
  end           End a session
  help          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
